{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01977",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 3.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.62,
      "end_seconds": 9.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "So, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.62,
      "end_seconds": 18.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "Right, you know, it's aching muscles in my thighs. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.83,
      "end_seconds": 23.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "How long has it it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.98,
      "end_seconds": 28.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "It's been going on for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.37,
      "end_seconds": 32.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.86,
      "end_seconds": 38.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "a three out of ten, uh, I suppose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.56,
      "end_seconds": 42.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.61,
      "end_seconds": 47.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "right, I take paracetamol, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.79,
      "end_seconds": 50.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "So, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.31,
      "end_seconds": 56.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "1 gram, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.08,
      "end_seconds": 69.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.13,
      "end_seconds": 74.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Well, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.67,
      "end_seconds": 79.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Right, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.82,
      "end_seconds": 84.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.4,
      "end_seconds": 87.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.17,
      "end_seconds": 95.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Yes, I had a cataract operation in my left eye, about a year ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.39,
      "end_seconds": 103.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.15,
      "end_seconds": 110.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.45,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.41,
      "end_seconds": 120.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.15,
      "end_seconds": 137.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Alright, have you noticed fever, chest pain or joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 144.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, chest pain or joint swelling, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.04,
      "end_seconds": 147.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.21,
      "end_seconds": 154.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.66,
      "end_seconds": 157.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.64,
      "end_seconds": 160.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.93,
      "end_seconds": 163.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.03,
      "end_seconds": 174.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.88,
      "end_seconds": 193.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 109 over 78, heart rate 78, temperature 36.5, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.76,
      "end_seconds": 198.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.07,
      "end_seconds": 210.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.01,
      "end_seconds": 212.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.1,
      "end_seconds": 235.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "The thigh muscles are tender and the strength is slightly reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.17,
      "end_seconds": 249.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.31,
      "text": "You can sit up now. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.82,
      "end_seconds": 252.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.59,
      "end_seconds": 263.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.91,
      "end_seconds": 288.12,
      "duration_seconds": 14.21,
      "text": "We will pause the statin for a few weeks while we check the blood tests. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.17,
      "end_seconds": 292.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.61,
      "end_seconds": 299.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the results. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.98,
      "end_seconds": 305.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "okay, you know, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
}